This sentinel file marks the unrenamed template. While it exists, build.py's
template-hygiene check (`_check_template_hygiene`) is suppressed so the
template itself can build its own guide-template.pdf with placeholders present in
README.md and CLAUDE.md.

`bootstrap.py` deletes this file (and itself) after substituting the fork's
own title, slug, and author into build.py / pixi.toml / README.md / CLAUDE.md.
